  "headline": "Micafungin is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a plant with OAI 2024-04-23 and a Class III recall 2024-07-02",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "E9", "E7", "E10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows micafungin is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 70771168301 identifies Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3013712903) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1236639 at that plant ended 2024-04-23 and was classified OAI with 10 observations including absence of written procedures and validation lacking for sterile drug products.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2024-08-29.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Recall D-0596-2024 for micafungin for injection 100 mg/vial manufactured for Northstar Rx LLC was initiated 2024-07-02 and classified Class III for cross contamination with other products.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Par Health, USA LLC posted a discontinuation notice on 2026-09-11, which appears on FDA's shortage list as To Be Discontinued.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Baxter Healthcare Corporation, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
